---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Astrology Guide - Understanding moonine & Guna Milan" description="Deep dive into Vedic Astrology matchmaking. Learn about the 8 Kootas, Ashta Koota matching, Manglik Dosha, and how moonine calculates compatibility.">
    <style>
        .guide-section {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .guide-section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #facc15;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            color: #000000;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .visual-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border: 1px solid #fde68a;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #fffdf0;
        }
        .visual-table th, .visual-table td {
            padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #fde68a;
            color: #000000;
        }
        .visual-table th {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            color: #000000;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }
        .score-badge {
            background: #fef3c7;
            color: #000000;
            padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            border: 1px solid #fde68a;
        }
        .dosha-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .dosha-card {
            background: #fffdf0;
            border: 1px solid #fde68a;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .dosha-title {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #000000;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .dosha-desc {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #000000;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
    </style>

    <h1>The moonine Astrology Guide</h1>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: #000000; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-weight: 500;">Ancient Vedic Wisdom meets Modern Matchmaking</p>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Ashta Koota (36 Points)</h2>
        <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
            <table class="visual-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Koota</th>
                        <th>Compatibility Aspect</th>
                        <th>Max Score</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Varna</strong></td>
                        <td>Spiritual development & work ego.</td>
                        <td><span class="score-badge">1 Point</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Vashya</strong></td>
                        <td>Mutual attraction & power dynamics.</td>
                        <td><span class="score-badge">2 Points</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Tara</strong></td>
                        <td>Health, well-being & longevity.</td>
                        <td><span class="score-badge">3 Points</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Yoni</strong></td>
                        <td>Biological & sexual compatibility.</td>
                        <td><span class="score-badge">4 Points</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Maitri</strong></td>
                        <td>Psychological friendship & shared values.</td>
                        <td><span class="score-badge">5 Points</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Gana</strong></td>
                        <td>Temperament & basic nature.</td>
                        <td><span class="score-badge">6 Points</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Bhakoot</strong></td>
                        <td>Emotional harmony & financial prosperity.</td>
                        <td><span class="score-badge">7 Points</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Nadi</strong></td>
                        <td>Genetic compatibility & progeny.</td>
                        <td><span class="score-badge">8 Points</span></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Doshas & Cancellations</h2>
        <div class="dosha-grid">
            <div class="dosha-card">
                <div class="dosha-title">🔥 Manglik Dosha</div>
                <div class="dosha-desc">Placement of Mars in specific houses from the Lagna (Ascendant). <strong>Cancellation:</strong> If both partners are Manglik, energies balance out.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="dosha-card">
                <div class="dosha-title">🌑 Bhakoot Dosha</div>
                <div class="dosha-desc">Moon sign distances (2/12, 5/9, 6/8). <strong>Cancellation:</strong> If Rasi lords are mutual friends or the same.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="dosha-card">
                <div class="dosha-title">🧬 Nadi Dosha</div>
                <div class="dosha-desc">Genetic mismatch. <strong>Cancellation:</strong> If partners share Rasi but have different Nakshatras, or vice versa.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="dosha-card">
                <div class="dosha-title">👹 Gana Dosha</div>
                <div class="dosha-desc">Clash of temperaments (Deva vs Rakshasa). Requires conscious emotional adjustment.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-section" style="background: #fffcf0; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 2rem; border: 1px solid #fde68a;">
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Match Categories</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <div style="font-size: 1.5rem;">✨</div>
                <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #000000;">Soul Connection</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #000000; opacity: 0.8;">Exceptional Guna & Nadi scores.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <div style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🤝</div>
                <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #000000;">Destined Union</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #000000; opacity: 0.8;">High overall harmony & friendship.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <div style="font-size: 1.5rem;">🌟</div>
                <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #000000;">Social Synergy</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #000000; opacity: 0.8;">Great for shared goals & prosperity.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0;">
        <a href="/" class="btn">Start Your Cosmic Matchmaking</a>
    </div>

</Layout>
